WEBVTT

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:15.370
Once, in times when humans
and demons mingled and coexisted,

00:00:15.370 --> 00:00:19.160
heroes traversed treacherous roads

00:00:19.160 --> 00:00:22.580
to rescue their abducted princess
from the Demon Castle.

00:00:39.160 --> 00:00:41.040
We've looped back around?!

00:00:44.990 --> 00:00:47.740
Having trouble, heroes?

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:49.700
That voice!

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:54.700
Haven't found the exit of
Hell's Abyss Labyrinth yet?

00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:58.200
My castle is still a long way from here.

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.040
Demon King!

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.080
Curse you! Return our princess!

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:11.580
Look at yourself struggle.

00:01:23.660 --> 00:01:25.740
Wait, Demon King!

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:28.370
Dawner, you okay?

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:30.370
While we dawdle here, the princess is...

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:35.580
I, Dawner the Hero,
will escape from this labyrinth

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:38.160
and save the princess from the Demon Castle!

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:48.580
How's it look?

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:50.720
Glow o' Wisp

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.080
Any more spots or scuffs?

00:01:50.720 --> 00:01:54.220
Killer Rhino Beetle

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:54.240
Nope! Upon my honor as part of the cleaning unit!

00:01:55.080 --> 00:02:00.620
These are the phoenix's first eggs
in a century, so security will be tight.

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.240
Can't leave a single stain or scratch.

00:02:12.240 --> 00:02:14.080
P-Princess?!

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.080
Hm?

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:50.990
"Second Night"
"The Princess and Furious Fluff"

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:55.540
Princess, what are you doing there?!

00:03:55.540 --> 00:03:58.910
We just cleaned that spot! What in the world--

00:03:58.910 --> 00:04:01.040
Hr hr-hr hrg.

00:04:01.040 --> 00:04:03.290
Huh? What'd you say?!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:06.020
I despise bugs

00:04:03.290 --> 00:04:04.870
Hr hr-hr hrg.

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:08.790
A little earlier...

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.870
I got a bug bite!

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:29.370
How awful. I wish I hadn't noticed.

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:32.370
It's so itchy now that I'm thinking about it.

00:04:32.370 --> 00:04:35.160
This never happened back home.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:38.670
Goodereste Castle, Princess's Room

00:04:37.290 --> 00:04:39.910
Princess, good morning.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:04:59.450
Wide open

00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:01.200
Wide open

00:05:01.950 --> 00:05:03.700
Jail cell, so it's wide open, too

00:05:04.990 --> 00:05:09.580
The Demon Castle is far from airtight.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:15.040
At this rate, my skin will be
polka dotted in a few days!

00:05:17.790 --> 00:05:20.660
I know! A mosquito net!

00:05:20.660 --> 00:05:22.580
I had a mosquito net back home.

00:05:24.160 --> 00:05:27.290
All right. If you lack something, make it.

00:05:28.100 --> 00:05:31.370
"Quest"
"Mosquito Net to Avoid Bug Bites"

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:36.080
But I'll need a pretty big piece of fabric.

00:05:36.080 --> 00:05:40.950
Something far larger than
the Ghost Shroud I used recently...

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:47.790
Princess! How dare you cut down
one of my henchmen?!

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:49.620
Monster Shroud

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.200
I don't need the face and hands.

00:05:58.200 --> 00:06:00.990
Is she actually a demon?!

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:03.740
Good, I have string, too.

00:06:03.740 --> 00:06:06.370
But where can I tie this?

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.660
Oh, over there!

00:06:11.660 --> 00:06:13.910
Phoenix Nest

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:17.160
But how to climb up those walls...

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:19.950
Plippety-pop. Plippety-pop.

00:06:19.950 --> 00:06:23.240
Princess, I'm here to take your dishes, meow!

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:24.410
Stamp Cat

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:28.240
Climb up... climb up...

00:06:24.830 --> 00:06:28.240
Plippety-pop. Plippety-pop. Hup.

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:37.200
Oh, how could you? Shoes aren't allowed in here!

00:06:37.200 --> 00:06:40.330
Oh, I'm sorry, meow!
I'll remove them right away, meow!

00:06:42.450 --> 00:06:46.080
Huh? Why'd you snatch them, meow?

00:06:46.080 --> 00:06:47.370
Let me borrow them.

00:06:47.370 --> 00:06:49.330
Wait, what?!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:50.740
Let me borrow them.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:53.370
What?! You lied about no shoes here, meow!

00:06:53.370 --> 00:06:54.490
Let me borrow them.

00:06:54.740 --> 00:06:55.950
Presently

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:01.950
Guards! Call the guards!

00:07:01.950 --> 00:07:03.790
We must report this!

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.330
What?!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.080
The princess is headed for the phoenix nest?!

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:14.240
Yes! The egg guard is on the move!

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:17.740
Hang on, why would the princess do such a thing?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:23.870
Phoenix eggs are valuable healing items.

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:28.450
Could it be that the princess
is doing this to help the hero?!

00:07:28.450 --> 00:07:31.580
The hero's that important to her?!

00:07:31.580 --> 00:07:34.450
Move out! Stop her at all costs!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:35.540
Yes, Your Majesty!

00:07:43.580 --> 00:07:45.910
All units, report!

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:48.870
Egg guard unit 1!

00:07:48.870 --> 00:07:52.160
The princess is about to reach the phoenix eggs!

00:07:52.160 --> 00:07:53.490
What?!

00:07:53.490 --> 00:07:57.120
Those are the first eggs in a century!
Don't let her get them!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:08:01.700
I'm getting married after this battle.

00:08:01.700 --> 00:08:03.830
Idiot! Don't rush into things.

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:06.160
What?! Don't joke about that stuff!

00:08:08.490 --> 00:08:11.950
The princess plans to steal the eggs
and give them to the hero!

00:08:11.950 --> 00:08:15.200
Seize her at all costs before
she touches the eggs!

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:18.620
There she is!

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.120
Will we make it?

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:26.080
Dammit!

00:08:34.870 --> 00:08:36.160
Good.

00:08:36.160 --> 00:08:37.240
--Oh?
--Hm?

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.490
--Huh?
--Wha--?

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.870
Hm? My bug bite healed.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:49.380
Amazing healing power    of phoenix eggs

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:51.620
Sh-She's climbing down!

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:54.240
--What?!
--Huh?!

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.540
What was she up there for?

00:08:56.540 --> 00:08:58.830
Who said she was going to steal them?!

00:08:58.830 --> 00:08:59.910
What?! Wanna go?

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:02.240
Yeah, come on!

00:09:02.240 --> 00:09:03.620
Bring it!

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:10.040
Now look at that!

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:15.080
A mosquito net every bit as
magnificent as the one back home!

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:23.290
Quest Complete

00:09:20.950 --> 00:09:22.620
Good job!

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:28.410
I don't know what all that noise is outside,

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:31.200
but I can't resist this temptation!

00:09:32.990 --> 00:09:37.540
To sleep feeling so secure. How marvelous!

00:09:39.740 --> 00:09:44.580
It's like I'm in my own
little world under this net.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:51.200
When I wake, my skin will remain unblemished.

00:09:51.200 --> 00:09:54.290
I worked hard... today...

00:09:56.370 --> 00:09:57.540
Zzz...

00:10:03.790 --> 00:10:06.120
The princess! What happened to the princess?!

00:10:10.700 --> 00:10:12.200
Er...

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.830
The princess has returned to her room.

00:10:14.830 --> 00:10:16.290
Huh?

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:20.080
But seriously, couldn't we afford
to give away <i>one</i> egg?

00:10:20.080 --> 00:10:21.080
Shh!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:29.980
"Ghost Shroud"
"Fabric Quality: ☆☆☆☆☆☆☆"
"Luck: ☆☆"

00:10:26.240 --> 00:10:27.950
<i>Sleepy Princess in the Demon Castle</i> .

00:10:36.990 --> 00:10:37.990
The exit!

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:38.990
Oh!

00:10:48.490 --> 00:10:49.740
Area Boss
Sand Dragon

00:10:50.290 --> 00:10:52.490
Oh, no! An ambush!

00:10:54.160 --> 00:10:55.240
Get down!

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:09.160
I won't let you demons get your way!

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:11.580
Dawner!

00:11:12.540 --> 00:11:14.200
It got Waker!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.790
Let's retreat to the castle for now!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:30.700
In times when humans and demons coexisted,
humans were by far the weaker being.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:35.330
And so in order to survive, humans feared demons

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:39.330
and avoided confrontation with them.

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:42.700
With one exception...

00:11:42.700 --> 00:11:48.830
Mm... let us begin the elders' council of the Demon Castle.

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:48.830
Forest Elder

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:54.410
Now, about this newly
harvested sleeping potion--

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:55.700
Hm?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.540
Ah, hello.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:09.240
Wh-What?!

00:12:09.240 --> 00:12:11.910
Hey, w-w-wait--

00:12:11.910 --> 00:12:12.910
Princess!

00:12:14.540 --> 00:12:17.370
We need that for our meeting.

00:12:21.790 --> 00:12:25.660
Come now, will you return it?

00:12:25.660 --> 00:12:32.330
Aw, I wanted to try out the new sleeping potion
to test its effects on sleep quality.

00:12:33.740 --> 00:12:35.240
I have no other choice.

00:12:35.240 --> 00:12:38.790
I shall obtain an object from the
item storage to improve my sleep.

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:42.370
"Quest"
"Item to Improve Sleep Quality"

00:12:51.660 --> 00:12:54.950
Unauthorized entry to the elders' council.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:13:00.540
96th Demon Castle code violation.

00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:07.120
Escape from prison.
97th Demon Castle code violation.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.330
These are...

00:13:20.330 --> 00:13:22.240
...fluffy mattresses!

00:13:27.990 --> 00:13:29.120
Restricted Area

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:32.330
All right. To better sleep quality.

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:33.240
Here I go!

00:13:33.240 --> 00:13:34.290
Hey!

00:13:40.870 --> 00:13:45.640
"Status Effects"
"Sleep"
"Poison"

00:13:49.950 --> 00:13:56.290
Unauthorized entry into restricted area.
98th Demon Castle code violation!

00:13:58.830 --> 00:14:02.620
What?! The princess died again?!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:08.040
Yes, Demon King. I revived her
in the Demon Church a moment ago.

00:14:08.040 --> 00:14:09.950
Did she fall into magma again?

00:14:09.950 --> 00:14:13.540
No, she slept on poisonous mushroom spores.

00:14:16.950 --> 00:14:18.870
Is she actually an idiot?

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:23.830
She's been dying once a week lately.

00:14:23.830 --> 00:14:25.490
Once a <i>week</i> ?!

00:14:25.490 --> 00:14:29.490
Yes, she was interested in the
Thunder Dragon last week, and then...

00:14:32.060 --> 00:14:33.080
Thunder Dragon

00:14:33.580 --> 00:14:35.040
Ooh!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:38.240
Hey, get back. It's dangerous.

00:14:38.240 --> 00:14:42.410
What do you want with
the Thunder Dragon, anyway?

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:46.700
Will she make it an ally to help her
escape the Demon Castle?!

00:14:46.700 --> 00:14:48.580
Huh? No.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.950
I want to relieve muscle knots
with its electric shocks.

00:14:50.950 --> 00:14:51.950
What?!

00:14:57.490 --> 00:15:00.120
Doesn't this stuff usually kill you?

00:15:00.120 --> 00:15:01.910
No kidding!

00:15:02.330 --> 00:15:03.330
Has no plan

00:15:03.580 --> 00:15:06.910
Jeez. What is she thinking--ah!

00:15:12.450 --> 00:15:12.930
Oh, no!

00:15:12.930 --> 00:15:14.330
Princess, run!

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.410
Huh?

00:15:17.450 --> 00:15:19.450
Princess!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:23.580
Princess! "I will value my life"!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:25.580
I will value my life.

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:27.870
"I won't jump in headfirst"!

00:15:27.870 --> 00:15:29.490
I won't jump in headfirst.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.870
That's what happened.

00:15:34.790 --> 00:15:37.490
She really is an idiot.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:42.740
Aw, that fluffy bed was a killer, huh?

00:15:42.740 --> 00:15:48.120
I need to get a sleeping potion
from the item storage, after all.

00:15:56.240 --> 00:16:01.870
Another escape from prison.
99th Demon Castle code violation.

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.290
That's--

00:16:12.280 --> 00:16:12.330
Red Siberians

00:16:12.330 --> 00:16:12.370
Red Siberians

00:16:12.370 --> 00:16:13.240
Red Siberians

00:16:17.290 --> 00:16:19.830
It's terrible!

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:23.080
One of the new demons is on a rampage.

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:26.620
We must use a sleeping potion to tranquilize it.

00:16:26.620 --> 00:16:28.290
What?!

00:16:28.290 --> 00:16:29.700
That's bad!

00:16:29.700 --> 00:16:30.990
Hurry and take this!

00:16:30.990 --> 00:16:33.120
Stop right there.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:39.490
Isn't the Demon King's signature
needed for use of stored items?

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:41.580
Who's there?! This is urgent--

00:16:41.580 --> 00:16:43.410
Quiet.

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:45.990
Unauthorized use of item storage.
100th Demon Castle code violation!

00:16:45.990 --> 00:16:49.450
This world requires rules.

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:59.700
Rules to preserve the world
of evil under the demon king,

00:16:59.700 --> 00:17:02.410
whom I respect and love!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.660
Great Red Siberian

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:10.080
Listen here. Use of valuable items
"must follow proper procedures."

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.700
And our captives "must truly fear us."

00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:20.620
By the way, isn't that cloak you wear

00:17:20.620 --> 00:17:26.740
one that was cut off from a subordinate
of mine, <i>captive princess</i> ?!

00:17:29.490 --> 00:17:31.410
You think I can't see you?!

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:34.240
N-Nevertheless, you will not escape me.

00:17:34.240 --> 00:17:40.660
Let's inspect your cell to celebrate
your 100th Demon Castle code violation!

00:17:44.660 --> 00:17:45.870
Say something!

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:55.200
My word, what a mess.

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:57.990
First, return the things you've filched.

00:18:03.540 --> 00:18:06.770
Superior healing 
potions (empty)

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:07.200
I'm not the bottle collector!

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:09.660
First off, your attitude is unacceptable!

00:18:09.660 --> 00:18:12.910
According to the article,
"Hostage in the Demon Castle,"

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:20.370
you, as the hostage, should be sleepless
out of fear of the great Demon King!

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:24.910
Don't make a spacey expression as if I
suddenly started talking about the cosmos!

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:26.200
Really.

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:28.580
So... what's that?

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:29.490
A tree.

00:18:29.490 --> 00:18:31.290
It's not just any tree!

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:34.080
If I recall, we had a seed to this holy tree--

00:18:34.080 --> 00:18:37.450
It was just lying there,
in a treasure chest in the noble armory.

00:18:37.450 --> 00:18:39.830
That's not "just lying there"!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:43.200
Next! Moving on!

00:18:43.200 --> 00:18:45.290
What are those huge scissors?

00:18:45.290 --> 00:18:46.790
Someone gave them to me.

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.660
Stamp Cat's shoes?

00:18:48.660 --> 00:18:49.910
Borrowing them.

00:18:49.910 --> 00:18:50.530
And those?!

00:18:50.530 --> 00:18:51.870
Made them.

00:18:51.870 --> 00:18:54.040
Hm? These are...

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.330
...Ghost Shroud bodies?!

00:18:56.330 --> 00:18:58.450
One, two, three, four...

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.950
Ghost Shroud body

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.950
Ghost Shroud body

00:19:00.950 --> 00:19:02.950
Ghost Shroud body

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:07.990
Just how many Ghost Shrouds did you--

00:19:07.990 --> 00:19:11.740
They should all have revived
in the church... probably.

00:19:11.740 --> 00:19:14.040
Are you truly a human?!

00:19:14.040 --> 00:19:17.200
And what's with this mountain of coffins?!

00:19:17.200 --> 00:19:18.660
Is this a cemetery?!

00:19:18.660 --> 00:19:20.160
Why do you have so many?

00:19:20.540 --> 00:19:25.980
"Stocked on capsule beds
since they always get taken back"

00:19:26.080 --> 00:19:27.290
Someone gave them to me.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:30.580
No wonder the vampires
have been lacking sleep lately!

00:19:31.830 --> 00:19:34.950
Huh? What was that?

00:19:34.950 --> 00:19:37.080
It was coming from here...

00:19:37.080 --> 00:19:38.240
That's---

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.290
My new pet. Give it back.

00:19:45.290 --> 00:19:47.290
You dare!

00:19:55.660 --> 00:19:58.200
No, this is fine.

00:19:58.200 --> 00:20:02.950
Being friendly with pets is
suitable for a captive princess.

00:20:02.950 --> 00:20:04.200
Take care of it.

00:20:04.200 --> 00:20:05.370
So this is fine?

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:08.620
The rest will be reclaimed!

00:20:11.950 --> 00:20:14.830
Really, this place was an unsightly mess.

00:20:14.830 --> 00:20:19.490
I must read to you from
<i>Code of the Demon Castle</i> .

00:20:19.490 --> 00:20:20.830
So soft.

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:22.830
Wake up!

00:20:22.830 --> 00:20:24.080
Come on, get up!

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:26.240
I'll start from article 1.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:31.790
Article 1! The ruling demon king comes from
the bloodline of great demons of noble blood.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:36.200
A drawn-out lecture like this is so nostalgic.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:36.200
The benevolent Twilight the Demon King,
our current ruler,

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:40.330
Hasn't happened since I was a child.

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:48.410
fulfills these requirements. It is the duty
of all demons to revere and love him!

00:20:40.330 --> 00:20:46.200
Huh? There's a bed before my very eyes.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.580
Continuing to article 2!

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.450
So... fluffy...

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:57.450
H-How dare you! What are you--

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.700
Hm? It's like a bed, but not quite like a bed...

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:01.700
Are you even listening?! Hey!

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:08.330
But it's been so long since I've slept with a lullaby.

00:21:01.700 --> 00:21:05.330
Get off! What is the meaning of this?!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:11.830
You hear me?! Hey! You can't be falling asleep--

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:11.830
It's quite... nice.

00:21:11.830 --> 00:21:13.410
Zzz...

